            "body": "This comes from `preview` flag in 'completeopt' option. It is not set in 'mini.completion' and is set before or after requiring 'mini.completion'. My suggestion would be to just remove manual 'completeopt' setting or use [suggested values](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/b5bae7dd5802b47bb03babfb374fdfdab02b9d8b/doc/mini-completion.txt#L87-L89).",
            "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">This comes from <code class=\"notranslate\">preview</code> flag in 'completeopt' option. It is not set in 'mini.completion' and is set before or after requiring 'mini.completion'. My suggestion would be to just remove manual 'completeopt' setting or use <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/blob/b5bae7dd5802b47bb03babfb374fdfdab02b9d8b/doc/mini-completion.txt#L87-L89\">suggested values</a>.</p>",
